  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole small biped with compact deep torso and long shins. Not skeletal display, tree-climber or miniature Iguanodon.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic living reconstruction based on NHM skeleton displays and its revised2024bronze cast. These mounted/composite reconstructions are not a complete single untouched fossil; the displayed accession was not established. Two metres is the current NHM approximate length, not a measured individual. Skin, colour and pose are inferred.\",\"zh\":\"依据NHM骨架展件和2024修订铜制翻模的完整活体美术复原。装架/合成复原非单件完整原位化石，展件编号未确证。2米取现行博物馆约数，非特定个体实测；皮肤、颜色和姿态属推断。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":367,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Hypsilophodon\",\"zh\":\"棱齿龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Hypsilophodon foxii\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Neornithischia\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":2.0,\"basis\":\"Current NHM dinosaur directory approximate length. Older GAC2.3m not adopted; no claim this is exact largest known specimen.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Compact deep ribcage behind a short neck and small beaked head with large eye region.\",\"Relatively short thigh and elongated shin/foot support a light terrestrial biped.\",\"Short free grasping arms with five-fingered hands, no Iguanodon thumb spike.\",\"Long narrow balancing tail, no tree-climbing curled tail or kangaroo tail-support stance.\",\"No invented armour, cranial crest, horns or obligatory feather coat.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Actually viewed NHM GAC mounted skeleton photo and NHM2024garden bronze-cast photo with revised skull. These provide broad morphology; accession unverified and not attributed to R197.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole small biped with compact deep torso and long shins. Not skeletal display, tree-climber or miniature Iguanodon.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic living reconstruction based on NHM skeleton displays and its revised2024bronze cast. These mounted/composite reconstructions are not a complete single untouched fossil; the displayed accession was not established. Two metres is the current NHM approximate length, not a measured individual. Skin, colour and pose are inferred.\",\"zh\":\"依据NHM骨架展件和2024修订铜制翻模的完整活体美术复原。装架/合成复原非单件完整原位化石，展件编号未确证。2米取现行博物馆约数，非特定个体实测；皮肤、颜色和姿态属推断。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":367,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Hypsilophodon\",\"zh\":\"棱齿龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Hypsilophodon foxii\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Ornithischia, Neornithischia\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":2.0,\"basis\":\"Current NHM dinosaur directory approximate length. Older GAC2.3m not adopted; no claim this is exact largest known specimen.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Compact deep ribcage behind a short neck and small beaked head with large eye region.\",\"Relatively short thigh and elongated shin/foot support a light terrestrial biped.\",\"Short free grasping arms with five-fingered hands, no Iguanodon thumb spike.\",\"Long narrow balancing tail, no tree-climbing curled tail or kangaroo tail-support stance.\",\"No invented armour, cranial crest, horns or obligatory feather coat.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Actually viewed NHM GAC mounted skeleton photo and NHM2024garden bronze-cast photo with revised skull. These provide broad morphology; accession unverified and not attributed to R197.\"}"
  },
